== pairs {0,b}: no good signs exactly when b is not a multiple of the largest power of 2 in n ?
  clock 2: 1 of the 2 pairs (0,b) have no good signs; power of 2 in n is 2
  clock 6: 3 of the 6 pairs (0,b) have no good signs; power of 2 in n is 2
  clock 12: 9 of the 12 pairs (0,b) have no good signs; power of 2 in n is 4
  clock 40: 35 of the 40 pairs (0,b) have no good signs; power of 2 in n is 8
  clock 56: 49 of the 56 pairs (0,b) have no good signs; power of 2 in n is 8
  all clocks 1..60 agree with the description: True
